Z||000003||DecadenceR||07-10-2001||01:36 AM||||We've been getting rain here, but they're just hard quick thunderstorms that flood everything and go away.<BR>I can't tell you how many roads in my area have been flooded lately from sudden t-storms. I've been here 15 years and rememebr 2 times roads got like that. Now it's been 3 times this season.<BR>Thank god I finally got that sunroof weatherstrip changed...||||reg||1
Z||000004||beer_stud_21||07-10-2001||07:10 PM||||Its VERY dry here to.  We normally get 300+ inches a year.  This year so far we have had something like 50- if that.  The worst part of it is where I live there isn't county water so we are on catchment.  No rain = no water.  When we run out we gotta buy more.  But there is a big waiting list so it really sucks.  One of these days we will get another 20+ inches in 24 hrs, but we still wont be caught up.  Damn this el nino or el nina whatever it is all to hell!<P>-Marlin||||reg||1
