Z||000008||Raydar||07-11-2001||12:44 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DJRice:<BR><B>What a change from last summer when everthing was burning...<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I'll second that. <BR>Georgia is getting way more rain than normal.<BR>We've been in a drought for the past three years, and we're about to make up for the three-year deficit, just from rain that has fallen this spring. <BR>I put lime and fertilizer on my grass a couple months ago, and it's just freakin' out of control, now. <P>I was in Oregon, a couple weeks ago. Those folks are having a <I>serious</I> drought. Way worse than we've seen in he South. Everything from the mountains, inland is just parched. The weeds beside the roads are even dying.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
